# Mount Hyjal - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 data-confirmed rares of Mount Hyjal. Run it
# in its own Polestar tab at the end of the core route or standalone. EVERY
# goal is optional: a rare that is not up never holds the route. Spawn points
# and levels are the local Forever game data (questie-forever); signature
# drops are items whose SOLE dropper anywhere in the data is the rare.
# Ordinary goods and generic multi-zone world drops get a note, not a goal.
# No tame lines ship: tameability has no data flag and no core quest kills a
# corroborating beast family for the two beast-plausible rares, so both tame
# questions are logged in docs/companion-unverified.md. Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No fixed treasure containers
# exist in the data (all 17 objects on key 2482 are core-contract points or
# scenery with no loot), so this guide ships no treasure steps - said plainly
# here and below. Core-quest mobs and vendors are cross-referenced, never
# duplicated: see docs/mount-hyjal-companions-inventory.md. This guide never
# accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/mount-hyjal-rares
title Mount Hyjal - Rares & Treasures
levels 54-60
zone Mount Hyjal
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords mount hyjal, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Death Wailer - the western wilds (come back later)

  zone map 2482

  note No fixed treasure containers exist anywhere in the data for Mount Hyjal, so this sweep is rares only.
  loop
  goto 21,58.57
  goto 21.03,75.42
  goto 21.67,57.47
  goto 22.32,56.73
  goto 23.93,57.93
  kill 249226 optional
  note Level 61 rare elite roaming the western wilds - one level above the 54-60 band, so come back at 61.
  note Shares the Drop of Stolen Life with three other droppers; core quest 92317 (Stolen Life) seeks that drop - see the core guide. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

