step Pexmit - south of the Crow and the northern front

  zone map 2482

  loop
  goto 45.74,82.52
  goto 46.84,80.67
  goto 48.22,33.77
  goto 48.81,34.11
  kill 266901 optional
  note Level 60 rare peddling south of the Crow and on the northern front. Buy his six recipes FIRST - see the recipes companion (Blacksmithing, Leatherworking, Tailoring, Alchemy, Engineering) - then kill him. No mob drops in the data. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Head Scratcher - the wormwing grounds

  zone map 2482

  loop
  goto 33.82,72.86
  goto 35.32,71.3
  goto 36.02,73.39
  goto 36.56,72.13
  kill 251199 optional
  note Level 60 elite on the wormwing grounds. Its signature drop, Head Scratcher's Scratchers, drops solely from him anywhere in the data - but only while holding the Horde-only quest 92446 (Head Scratcher), so Alliance players will never see it lootable; hunt him for the kill. Beast-shaped but no tame line: the data has no tameability flag and no core quest corroborates the family - logged in docs/companion-unverified.md. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

